<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sapura year net down 44.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sapura year net down 44.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   7.05   vs	  12.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  5.03   vs	   9.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		   345.26   vs	 384.49</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    13.21   vs	  13.37</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.11   vs  add    0.38</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     4.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia Sapura Telecommunications Bhd is involved in manufacturing and distributing telecommunications products and services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2233)</p>
</text>
